; Own import library (port's portable toolchain): only the names used by the emitted C.
LIBRARY kernel32.dll
EXPORTS
    GetCurrentProcess
    GetCurrentProcessId
    GetCurrentThreadId
    GetModuleHandleExA
    GetModuleHandleA
    GetProcAddress
    Sleep
    DisableThreadLibraryCalls
    QueryPerformanceCounter
    QueryPerformanceFrequency
    OutputDebugStringA
    K32EnumProcessModules
    GetSystemTimeAsFileTime
    GetModuleFileNameA
    GetTickCount64
    AcquireSRWLockExclusive
    ReleaseSRWLockExclusive
